    "title": "gascity pack inference gate: build-basic",
    "description": "Default Gas City implementation of build-base.\n\nThis concrete workflow uses the built-in Gas City requirement, design review,\ndecomposition, implementation, review, and publish helpers while preserving the\nsame full-lifecycle stage contract exposed by build-base.\n",
